  "description": "QIYTIB crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C67 H122 O13 Sm4,C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 5 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.560-3.828 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.06-111.64°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Sm4(μ3-O-i-Pr)3(μ2-O-i-Pr)4(O-i-Pr)2(O-2,6-i-Pr2C6H3)3(THF)·n-C6H14.",
